# ============================================================
# 背记系统 .gitattributes
#
# 背景：开发机是 Windows（core.autocrlf 默认为 true），而服务端会部署到
# 局域网内的 Linux 机器。若不放这份文件，CRLF/LF 会随 checkout 环境漂移，
# 表现为「没改代码却整仓 diff」以及 shell 脚本在 Linux 上因 \r 报
# `bad interpreter: /bin/bash^M`。这里统一钉死：
#   仓库内一律存 LF；只有 Windows 专用脚本在 checkout 时还原成 CRLF。
# ============================================================

# 默认：文本文件存 LF
* text=auto eol=lf

# ---- Windows 专用脚本必须 CRLF（否则 cmd.exe / PowerShell 解析出错）----
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# ---- 二进制：禁止任何换行转换 ----
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.bmp binary
*.webp binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.m4a binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
*.p12 binary
*.pfx binary
*.pem binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.db binary

# ---- 生成/锁文件：不参与 diff 统计与语言识别 ----
package-lock.json -diff -linguist-detectable
pnpm-lock.yaml   -diff -linguist-detectable
pubspec.lock     -diff -linguist-detectable
